@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### List projects
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/projects

### Get project
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/1

### Create project (owner 2 = seeded manager)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/projects
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "New project", "description": "Created via .http file", "ownerId": 2 }

### Invalid payload -> 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/projects
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "", "ownerId": 0 }

### Unknown owner -> 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/projects
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "X", "ownerId": 9999 }
